(7569383, 1214678, 100831, '<td valign="top">Congrats... would love to know where this was taken.</td>', 'Congrats... would love to know where this was taken.', '2018-05-28 01:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569384, 1214863, 104230, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot that also brings back memories. I was living in Baltimore when this museum opened in the mid 1990''s. It was a great addition to the city and came about as a result of an interesting arrangement that lead to the clean up of the previously industrial site in a (then) undeveloped area not far from Baltimore''s Inner Harbor development.  Now I believe there are several waterfront residential towers and a hotel close by.</td>', 'A wonderful shot that also brings back memories. I was living in Baltimore when this museum opened in the mid 1990''s. It was a great addition to the city and came about as a result of an interesting arrangement that lead to the clean up of the previously industrial site in a (then) undeveloped area not far from Baltimore''s Inner Harbor development.  Now I believe there are several waterfront residential towers and a hotel close by.', '2018-05-28 01:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569385, 1214886, 100831, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten! Interesting structure.</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten! Interesting structure.', '2018-05-28 01:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569386, 1214678, 34171, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats... would love to know where this was taken. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you. This is the Sundial Bridge in Redding, CA.</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyStreet: Congrats... would love to know where this was taken.  Thank you. This is the Sundial Bridge in Redding, CA.', '2018-05-28 01:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569392, 1214878, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think I see Willie Wonka</td>', 'I think I see Willie Wonka', '2018-05-28 10:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569398, 1214886, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very interesting structures - in the garden? - everything looks odd because of the relationship between elements. The "hives" look huge but the people next to them diminish them, then the tree overpowers everything but its trunk is like a twig. The sky takes revenge. Fascinating</td>', 'Very interesting structures - in the garden? - everything looks odd because of the relationship between elements. The "hives" look huge but the people next to them diminish them, then the tree overpowers everything but its trunk is like a twig. The sky takes revenge. Fascinating', '2018-05-28 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
